Open PMS - Dental
=================

Open PMS - Dental is a fork of Open Dental (c) Open Dental Software, Inc. and contributors, licensed under the GNU GPL v2. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Open Dental Software, Inc.

Origin
------
This program is based on the Open Dental source code, version 24.3.63.0, as
published under the GNU General Public License, version 2. Changes made in
this fork are described in the git history and in docs/decoupling-plan.md.
Features from later Open Dental versions are re-implemented from Open
Dental's public documentation; no Open Dental binaries are decompiled.

"Open Dental" is a name of Open Dental Software, Inc. It is used here only to
say where this program comes from. Some internal names (namespaces,
assemblies, executable and window titles) still read "Open Dental" until a
later rename step; they do not mean this program is Open Dental's product.

